WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.820
-[Kinger]: [snoring]

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:02.320
-[Caine]: [over speakers]
Rise and shine, sleepy head!

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.460
-[Kinger]: What?
Who's there?

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.480
-[Caine]: [sing-song]
I've got another pop-up for you!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.750
-[Kinger]: Yeah, that's gonna be
a big no from me.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:11.030
-[Caine]: No, no, Kinger-boy.
I'm not being ignored by you any more.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.090
-[Kinger]: WHAT?
[coughs]

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.300
-[Caine]: If you don't love me,
maybe I'll find someone else who will.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.130
-[Queenie]: Help me!!
-[Kinger]: W-WIFE?!

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:25.380
-[Queenie]: Kinger!
-[Kinger]: Wife!

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.710
-[Queenie]: How did you
even get here?

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.700
-[Kinger]: No time!
We gotta go before --

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:31.660
-[Caine]: [babbles]
[screams]

00:01:58.330 --> 00:01:59.460
-[Kinger]: OH!
Where am I?!

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:00.820
-[Pomni]: Whoa there, Kinger.

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.390
Just relax, okay?

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.000
You really knocked your head hard.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.500
-[Ragatha]: Oh, it's good
to see you up again, Kinger.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.950
We were worried about you.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:10.380
-[Kinger]: Oh, it was just terrible!
I had this --

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.120
-[Narrator]: [monotone] Wonderful dream
about the all-new Caine puppet

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:14.270
and Queenie plush,

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:17.340
along with the release
of new Animatez figurines.

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.980
-[Ragatha]:
Wait, they tried to sell you --

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.920
-[Narrator]:
The incredible Kinger pendant

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.700
and sideshow Animiniz,

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:25.800
both with their own
super rare figures to collect.

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:26.920
-[Ragatha]: Wow.
That's, uh --

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:30.720
-[Narrator]: 20% off Digital Circus items
for a limited time only.

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:33.060
-[Pomni]: Well, we're just happy
to have you back.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.000
-[Kinger]: Yep.
There's no place like --

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:37.680
-[Narrator]: digitalcircus.store

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:38.260
[terrifying antiquated audio blares]

